  "text": "proprium.dominica-v-post-pascha-evangelium",
  "about": "In this Gospel for the Fifth Sunday after Easter (John 16:23–30), Jesus promises that the Father will grant what His disciples ask in His name. He speaks of coming from the Father and returning to Him, and the disciples profess their belief that He came from God.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "At that time, Jesus said to His disciples: “Truly, truly, I tell you: if you ask the Father for anything in My name, He will give it to you. Until now you have not asked for anything in My name. Ask, and you will receive, so that your joy may be complete. I have spoken these things to you in figures of speech. The hour is coming when I will no longer speak to you in figures of speech, but will tell you plainly about the Father. On that day you will ask in My name. And I do not say to you that I will ask the Father on your behalf, for the Father Himself loves you, because you have loved Me and have believed that I came forth from God. I came forth from the Father and came into the world. Again, I leave the world and go to the Father.” His disciples say to Him: “See, now You speak plainly and use no figure of speech. Now we know that You know everything and have no need for anyone to question You. By this we believe that You came forth from God.”", "alignments": [{ "words": ["w006", "w007"], "anchor": "w006", "gloss": "to His disciples" }, { "words": ["w017", "w018"], "anchor": "w017", "gloss": "My name" }, { "words": ["w023", "w024"], "anchor": "w024", "gloss": "you have not asked" }, { "words": ["w027", "w028"], "anchor": "w027", "gloss": "My name" }, { "words": ["w033", "w034"], "anchor": "w033", "gloss": "your joy" }, { "words": ["w040", "w041"], "anchor": "w040", "gloss": "I have spoken" }, { "words": ["w043", "w044"], "anchor": "w043", "gloss": "The hour is coming" }, { "words": ["w046", "w047"], "anchor": "w047", "gloss": "no longer" }, { "words": ["w062", "w063"], "anchor": "w062", "gloss": "My name" }, { "words": ["w066", "w067"], "anchor": "w067", "gloss": "I do not say" }, { "words": ["w075", "w076", "w077"], "anchor": "w077", "gloss": "for the Father Himself" }, { "words": ["w082", "w083"], "anchor": "w083", "gloss": "have loved Me" }, { "words": ["w107", "w108"], "anchor": "w107", "gloss": "His disciples" }, { "words": ["w114", "w115", "w116"], "anchor": "w116", "gloss": "You use no figure of speech" }, { "words": ["w123", "w124", "w125", "w126"], "anchor": "w124", "gloss": "You have no need" }, { "words": ["w129", "w130"], "anchor": "w130", "gloss": "to question You" }] }
